  <question type="multichoice">
    <name><text>S16 C1 — The trilemma</text></name>
    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>The scalability trilemma is a trade-off among which three goals?</p>]]></text></questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Decentralization, security, and scalability &mdash; improving one usually costs another.</p>]]></text></generalfeedback>
